---
import Icon from '~/components/Icon.astro';
import PageHeader from '~/components/PageHeader.astro';
import Section from '~/components/Section.astro';
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import { formatVersion, getSiteData } from '~/lib/data';
import { formatBytes } from '~/lib/highlight';
import { recovered } from '~/lib/lab';
import { SITE } from '~/lib/site';

const { samples, obf } = await getSiteData();
const runCols = [...new Set(samples.flatMap((s) => s.runs.map((r) => r.id)))].sort();
const totalRuns = samples.reduce((a, s) => a + s.runs.length, 0);

const steps = [
  { icon: 'file' as const, title: 'Corpus script', text: 'Written by us, with a deterministic expected output.' },
  { icon: 'shield' as const, title: 'Obfuscator', text: 'Run by a maintainer with documented settings.' },
  { icon: 'unlock' as const, title: 'Deobfuscator', text: 'Every tool that claims support gets a try.' },
  { icon: 'check' as const, title: 'luau CLI', text: 'All three stages run, and stdout must match exactly.' },
];
---

<Base title="The Lab" description="Our own benchmark corpus: scripts we wrote, run through every obfuscator and deobfuscator, verified with the official Luau CLI.">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Benchmark"
    title="The Lab"
    description="Scripts we wrote ourselves, run through each obfuscator and then each deobfuscator. A break only counts as a recovery here if the output behaves exactly like the original."
  />

  <div class="container-page space-y-14 py-10">
    <ol class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line bg-line sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4" aria-label="Pipeline">
      {
        steps.map((s, i) => (
          <li class="relative bg-elev p-5">
            <span class="num text-xs text-subtle">0{i + 1}</span>
            <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2">
              <Icon name={s.icon} size={16} class="text-muted" />
              <h2 class="font-semibold tracking-tight">{s.title}</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted">{s.text}</p>
            {i < steps.length - 1 && (
              <Icon name="chevron-right" size={16} class="absolute top-1/2 -right-2 z-10 hidden -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-elev text-subtle lg:block" />
            )}
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>

    <Section id="corpus" title="Corpus" description={`${samples.length} scripts, each exercising a different weak spot.`}>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {
          samples.map((s, i) => (
            <article class="surface card-hover relative flex flex-col p-5" data-reveal style={`--reveal-i:${i}`}>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight">
                  <a href={`/lab/${s.id}`} class="card-link">
                    {s.meta.title}
                  </a>
                </h3>
                {s.result && (
                  <span class="chip" title={s.result.ok ? 'Original matches expected output' : s.result.error}>
                    <Icon name={s.result.ok ? 'check' : 'x'} size={13} class={s.result.ok ? 'text-holding' : 'text-broken'} />
                    {s.result.ok ? 'Verified' : 'Failing'}
                  </span>
                )}
              </div>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{s.meta.description}</p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                {s.meta.exercises.slice(0, 4).map((e) => (
                  <span class="chip">{e}</span>
                ))}
                {s.meta.exercises.length > 4 && <span class="chip">+{s.meta.exercises.length - 4}</span>}
              </div>
              <p class="num mt-auto pt-4 text-xs text-subtle">
                {s.lines} lines · {formatBytes(s.bytes)} · {s.runs.length} run{s.runs.length === 1 ? '' : 's'}
              </p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </Section>

    <Section id="matrix" title="Results" description="Each cell shows one obfuscator build of one sample, and whether any deobfuscator recovered matching behavior.">
      {
        totalRuns ? (
          <div class="surface overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full min-w-[36rem] text-left text-sm">
              <thead class="border-b border-line bg-sunken text-xs text-subtle">
                <tr>
                  <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-2.5 font-medium">Sample</th>
                  {runCols.map((c) => {
                    const [o, v] = [c.slice(0, c.lastIndexOf('@')), c.slice(c.lastIndexOf('@') + 1)];
                    return (
                      <th scope="col" class="px-4 py-2.5 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">
                        {obf.get(o)?.data.name ?? o} <span class="num">{formatVersion(v)}</span>
                      </th>
                    );
                  })}
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody class="divide-y divide-line">
                {samples.map((s) => (
                  <tr>
                    <th scope="row" class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-fg">
                      <a href={`/lab/${s.id}`} class="hover:underline">
                        {s.meta.title}
                      </a>
                    </th>
                    {runCols.map((c) => {
                      const run = s.runs.find((r) => r.id === c);
                      if (!run) return <td class="px-4 py-3 text-subtle">—</td>;
                      const rec = recovered(run);
                      return (
                        <td class="px-4 py-3">
                          <a href={`/lab/${s.id}/${run.id}`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:underline">
                            <Icon name={rec ? 'unlock' : 'shield'} size={14} class={rec ? 'text-broken' : 'text-holding'} />
                            <span class="text-fg">{rec ? 'Recovered' : run.deob.length ? 'Held' : 'No tools run'}</span>
                            <span class="num text-xs text-subtle">×{(run.bytes / s.bytes).toFixed(0)}</span>
                          </a>
                        </td>
                      );
                    })}
                  </tr>
                ))}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        ) : (
          <div class="surface flex items-start gap-3 p-6 text-sm text-muted">
            <Icon name="flask" size={18} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0" />
            <p>
              No obfuscator runs have been committed yet. The corpus and the harness are ready; runs are added by maintainers as they obtain
              builds. Until then, every obfuscator gets neutral half credit for the Lab part of its score.
            </p>
          </div>
        )
      }
    </Section>

    <Section id="contribute" title="Add a run">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <ol class="prose-site min-w-0 list-decimal pl-5 text-sm break-words">
          <li>Obfuscate <code>lab/corpus/&lt;sample&gt;/source.luau</code> with the obfuscator's current version.</li>
          <li>Save the result as <code>lab/runs/&lt;sample&gt;/&lt;obfuscator&gt;@&lt;version&gt;/obfuscated.luau</code>, plus a <code>meta.yaml</code> recording the settings, date and who ran it.</li>
          <li>Run each deobfuscator that claims support. Save its output under <code>deob/&lt;tool&gt;@&lt;version&gt;/output.luau</code>, with its own <code>meta.yaml</code>.</li>
          <li>Run <code>pnpm lab:verify</code> to execute every stage with the <code>luau</code> CLI and update <code>lab/results.json</code>.</li>
          <li>Open a pull request. CI re-runs the check and rejects stale results.</li>
        </ol>
        <pre class="surface num overflow-x-auto p-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">{`lab/runs/control-flow/luraph@15/
├── meta.yaml          # settings, date, by
├── obfuscated.luau
└── deob/
    └── deobfuscator-luraph-v15@main/
        ├── meta.yaml
        └── output.luau`}</pre>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">
        The folder names must match slugs and versions in the dataset, and <code class="num text-fg">pnpm validate</code> checks that they do. See the{' '}
        <a href={`${SITE.repo}/tree/main/lab`} class="link">lab folder</a> on GitHub.
      </p>
    </Section>
  </div>
</Base>
